{"_id":"QalmAbsol0000000","name":"Spell Effect: Calm (Absolute)","type":"effect","img":"modules/pf2e-vibemodulerp/img/calm-absolute.webp","folder":null,"system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b515AZlB0sridKSq]{Calm} when a creature <strong>critically fails</strong> its Will save.</p><p>The creature is fully calmed: any emotion effects that would affect it are suppressed and it can't use hostile actions. Unlike a regular failure, being subject to hostility from another creature does <strong>not</strong> end the effect.</p><p>This is the <strong>strongest</strong> of the three Calm effects — it persists even when the creature is attacked.</p>"},"duration":{"expiry":"turn-start","sustained":true,"unit":"minutes","value":1},"level":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"attack","type":"status","value":-1}],"start":{"initiative":null,"value":0},"tokenIcon":{"show":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"slug":"spell-effect-calm-absolute","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.0","createdBySource":""}}
{"_id":"QalmMinor0000000","name":"Spell Effect: Calm (Minor)","type":"effect","img":"modules/pf2e-vibemodulerp/img/calm-minor.webp","folder":null,"system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b515AZlB0sridKSq]{Calm} when a creature <strong>succeeds</strong> its Will save.</p><p>Calming urges impose a <strong>-1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls</strong>.</p><p>This is the <strong>weakest</strong> of the three Calm effects. Unlike <em>Spell Effect: Calm</em> (failure) and <em>Spell Effect: Calm (Absolute)</em> (critical failure), the creature is not otherwise restricted in what it can do.</p>"},"duration":{"expiry":"turn-start","sustained":true,"unit":"minutes","value":1},"level":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"attack","type":"status","value":-1}],"start":{"initiative":null,"value":0},"tokenIcon":{"show":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"slug":"spell-effect-calm-minor","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.0","createdBySource":""}}
